From 48b0b46a89331d51dd56edf50028d2c1c2debbdb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 1785235376-blip <1785235376-blip@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 15:59:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat: close Phase 1 window-facing honesty gaps

Replace overview and research placeholders with real sidecar-backed
windows, report deterministic agent jobs as VALIDATED without review
or apply, and keep unconfigured video tasks PENDING with
VIDEO_PROVIDER_NOT_CONFIGURED instead of placeholder success URIs.

Not a DesktopHost DH-01..DH-08 window pass and not V1.0. The four
known Python baseline defects are left untouched.

See docs/grok_phase1_feature_handoff.md for Codex merge notes.
